---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Evolution | Jon's Game Guides" description="Development hub for Evolution, a biologically grounded turn-based evolution RPG.">
<section class="evolution-hero"><div class="container">
<div class="kicker">Game in development</div><h1>EVOLUTION</h1>
<p>A biologically grounded, overhead 2D turn-based RPG about surviving, adapting, and building an organism through meaningful evolutionary choices.</p>
<div class="hero-actions"><span class="button disabled">Play build · coming later</span><a class="button secondary" href="#roadmap">View development status</a></div>
</div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="container evolution-grid">
<div class="evolution-card featured-evo"><div class="kicker">Current playable stage</div><h2>Primordial Soup</h2><p>The opening stage focuses on survival, resource pressure, movement, combat readiness, and the first meaningful evolutionary tradeoffs.</p><div class="tag-row"><span>4400 × 4400 world</span><span>Deterministic seed</span><span>Turn-based combat</span></div></div>
<div class="evolution-card"><div class="kicker">Core identity</div><h3>Adaptation over classes</h3><p>Stats are tied to biological traits such as metabolic efficiency, camouflage, bone density, and nervous-system responsiveness.</p></div>
<div class="evolution-card"><div class="kicker">Combat</div><h3>Read, react, evolve</h3><p>Camouflage, Vent, Disengage, positioning, sensory information, and organism-specific strengths create different viable approaches.</p></div>
</div></section>
<section class="section alt-section" id="roadmap"><div class="container">
<div class="section-heading"><div><div class="kicker">Development</div><h2>Current status</h2></div></div>
<div class="milestone-list">
<div class="milestone complete"><span>✓</span><div><strong>Foundation</strong><small>Project architecture and core simulation structure</small></div></div>
<div class="milestone complete"><span>✓</span><div><strong>Overworld foundation</strong><small>Procedural Primordial Soup world and movement systems</small></div></div>
<div class="milestone complete"><span>✓</span><div><strong>Combat foundation</strong><small>Enemy intent, Camouflage, Vent, Disengage, readiness, and safe-passage mechanics</small></div></div>
<div class="milestone active"><span>→</span><div><strong>Ecosystem & progression</strong><small>Persistent enemies, resources, wounds, carrying capacity, migration, variants, and boss progression</small></div></div>
<div class="milestone"><span>•</span><div><strong>Web play build</strong><small>This site is already structured to host the playable browser build when it is ready</small></div></div>
</div>
</div></section>
</BaseLayout>